WEBVTT

00:06.416 --> 00:09.500
[The following program is a true story.]

00:09.583 --> 00:12.333
[At least some of it is... untrue.]

00:12.500 --> 00:14.250
[True.]

00:16.536 --> 00:18.536
[10AM - Day 4 Tet]
Why are we doing this, Mother?

00:18.561 --> 00:19.436
Because of you!

00:20.435 --> 00:22.420
When have you ever understood
what I need to do?

00:22.911 --> 00:23.790
That’s why...

00:24.166 --> 00:25.808
I have to do everything myself,
to get it right.

00:26.848 --> 00:28.366
Let it roll down the front.
I got the back.

00:28.520 --> 00:30.025
- Got it.
- Just push it, Mother.

00:30.050 --> 00:31.050
I can bear it.

00:33.186 --> 00:36.444
Mai should have a proper funeral
and be buried in the ground.

00:36.965 --> 00:38.913
Mai would not have wanted this.

00:39.754 --> 00:43.947
And you think... That you know what
our dead daughter would have wanted?

00:44.674 --> 00:46.258
She wouldn’t have wanted to be kidnapped!

00:46.895 --> 00:48.423
She wouldn’t have wanted to be raped!

00:48.540 --> 00:49.728
Or murdered!

00:50.619 --> 00:53.071
If you hadn’t prevented the coroner
from doing a proper autopsy,

00:53.096 --> 00:54.386
then we wouldn’t be here.

00:54.411 --> 00:56.274
And wouldn’t have to do all of this!

00:58.547 --> 00:59.686
What’s going on, Auntie?

01:01.286 --> 01:02.206
Little Mai...

01:02.517 --> 01:04.104
Long’s cousin...

01:04.501 --> 01:06.543
She wants to lay here!

01:06.877 --> 01:09.187
Until Long and the cops...

01:09.548 --> 01:12.979
reopen the case and perform
another autopsy.

01:13.759 --> 01:15.584
And arrest the murderers,

01:16.369 --> 01:18.369
only then will she leave in peace.

01:54.666 --> 01:59.958
MISSING: EVE OF TET

02:00.708 --> 02:04.125
Episode 5: Xuan

02:07.000 --> 02:10.458
[10AM - 5 years ago]

02:43.570 --> 02:44.916
Honey, you’re home!

02:49.879 --> 02:50.715
Honey.

02:52.848 --> 02:55.843
I was thinking about knocking down
this wall, and putting the crib inside.

02:55.868 --> 02:57.838
It’ll be as if our baby is
sleeping next to us.

02:59.859 --> 03:01.204
Hold off on the wall.

03:10.070 --> 03:11.531
Did you already get the results?

03:14.328 --> 03:15.650
What did the doctor say?

03:18.116 --> 03:19.193
I’m normal.

03:21.858 --> 03:23.260
I’m not the reason.

03:39.941 --> 03:41.504
Are you going to leave me?

03:47.848 --> 03:48.801
Honey...

03:51.970 --> 03:53.949
I promise to obey you.

03:54.644 --> 03:56.359
I’ll obey your every word.

03:58.463 --> 04:00.213
If you still want a baby,

04:01.754 --> 04:03.666
then you can take another wife.

04:08.485 --> 04:09.944
Just don’t leave me.

04:11.559 --> 04:12.478
Please.

04:27.625 --> 04:28.818
What good...

04:30.891 --> 04:32.268
Is a baby for anyway?

04:39.891 --> 04:40.797
Dan.

04:42.122 --> 04:42.830
Listen...

04:44.242 --> 04:45.930
I’ll cover up this hole.

04:46.085 --> 04:47.551
I’ll board up this crawl space.

04:48.033 --> 04:50.298
You won’t ever be pained
by the sight of it.

05:03.641 --> 05:05.182
Just raise a dog there.

05:42.166 --> 05:45.625
[6PM - New Year’s Eve]

05:52.296 --> 05:53.447
Have you gone nuts?

05:53.500 --> 05:55.071
Who’s the girl? Why would you
bring her here?

05:55.096 --> 05:56.092
Why tie her up?

05:56.117 --> 05:56.978
Shut up!

06:01.872 --> 06:02.730
Dan.

06:03.072 --> 06:04.012
Did you grab her?

06:04.037 --> 06:05.162
I got her.

06:05.523 --> 06:07.401
Bring the money here tonight.

06:07.588 --> 06:08.638
And I’ll hand her over.

06:09.739 --> 06:10.798
Hey, no!

06:10.866 --> 06:12.542
I catch. You keep.

06:12.629 --> 06:13.625
Don’t change the deal!

06:13.650 --> 06:15.029
My home is not a hotel

06:18.398 --> 06:19.753
Who were you talking to?

06:20.622 --> 06:21.843
Not your business.

06:23.247 --> 06:24.673
Who’s the girl?

06:24.866 --> 06:25.864
Cargo.

06:26.413 --> 06:27.458
Delivering tomorrow.

06:28.476 --> 06:29.184
No!

06:29.372 --> 06:30.461
I object!

06:30.939 --> 06:32.872
I don’t want any part of this!

06:36.827 --> 06:37.803
You...

06:38.126 --> 06:39.585
Are already a part of this.

06:40.718 --> 06:42.091
Best to keep your mouth shut!

06:43.468 --> 06:44.620
Watch over her!

06:45.937 --> 06:47.120
If she makes noise,

06:47.340 --> 06:48.617
we’ll both get arrested.

06:49.571 --> 06:51.138
I’ve been to prison.

06:51.684 --> 06:52.767
Trust me.

06:53.548 --> 06:54.840
It doesn’t suit you.

07:09.137 --> 07:10.718
It’s only for tonight.

07:10.898 --> 07:13.048
When her mother pays Co,

07:13.236 --> 07:15.190
you and I will get 50 mil!

07:17.262 --> 07:18.876
You don’t have to be afraid.

07:19.369 --> 07:20.770
We’ll be fine.

07:28.734 --> 07:30.124
Trust me.

07:48.243 --> 07:49.285
Where is this justice?

07:49.310 --> 07:50.808
[9PM - Day 3 Tet]
When the killer is still out there!

07:50.833 --> 07:54.200
Nguyen Chau Bau is a junkie, how could he
be the killer? He can barely walk straight!

07:54.225 --> 07:57.079
Anyone who thinks that he can
do this alone should think again!

07:57.104 --> 07:58.482
I swear to you, it’s not over!

07:58.507 --> 08:01.630
I will continue to search for the
killers until they are all behind bars!

08:01.723 --> 08:03.448
Miss Hoa! Miss Hoa!

08:07.814 --> 08:09.096
Why so late, honey?

08:11.244 --> 08:12.402
Let me get that for you.

08:13.852 --> 08:15.285
I can do it.

08:16.970 --> 08:18.149
Please, sit down.

08:19.562 --> 08:22.467
Sit over here, honey.
Let me warm up the food first.

08:24.172 --> 08:25.451
There’s no need.

08:27.445 --> 08:28.861
I can eat it like this.

08:33.160 --> 08:34.759
I was watching the news.

08:35.179 --> 08:36.968
Looks like Auntie
was causing trouble again.

08:37.340 --> 08:38.332
Why’s that?

08:39.595 --> 08:41.143
Is the case not closed?

08:44.960 --> 08:45.897
Not yet.

08:47.267 --> 08:49.309
The Captain has already closed the case.

08:50.492 --> 08:52.033
I may even get promoted.

08:53.942 --> 08:55.812
For getting Bau’s confession.

09:00.200 --> 09:01.450
Then why are you sad?

09:28.525 --> 09:29.715
Feel something?

09:30.265 --> 09:32.161
Our daughter just kicked!

09:33.171 --> 09:34.169
Daughter?

09:42.200 --> 09:45.117
I know... We promised each other....

09:45.142 --> 09:47.583
That we would wait til the baby
comes to find out...

09:48.422 --> 09:50.588
But the wait is too long.

10:12.202 --> 10:14.058
[8AM - Day 4 Tet]
According to the marks around her neck,

10:14.083 --> 10:16.237
Mai was most likely strangled to death.

10:16.559 --> 10:18.722
From the ligature marks
around her wrists and ankles,

10:18.746 --> 10:20.997
she was may also have been bound
before she was killed.

10:21.299 --> 10:24.424
From this bruising here...
Sorry, maybe I should skip this part.

10:24.725 --> 10:27.333
It’s possible that she was raped.

10:28.095 --> 10:32.624
Everything that I have shared with you,
I’ve noted in my report to the police.

10:34.160 --> 10:35.648
Please give me the dress.

10:35.971 --> 10:38.505
I’ll make sure they put that dress
on her before returning her to you.

10:39.235 --> 10:40.172
Return?

10:40.606 --> 10:42.367
Why not continue the autopsy?

10:43.246 --> 10:45.346
Her killers are still out there!

10:45.718 --> 10:47.332
I thought that the killer has confessed.

10:47.586 --> 10:49.274
There’s more than one.

10:49.394 --> 10:51.523
Didn’t you find anyone else DNA on her?

10:51.611 --> 10:53.917
There may be more evidence on her body,

10:53.942 --> 10:56.938
but we couldn’t continue because the family
wouldn’t allow us to operate on her.

10:57.656 --> 10:59.655
Who in this family wouldn’t allow it?

11:11.665 --> 11:12.964
I approve.

11:13.263 --> 11:15.863
You may open my daughter
up for examination.

11:18.247 --> 11:19.775
The case has been closed.

11:19.800 --> 11:21.223
I am not allowed to proceed.

11:22.283 --> 11:24.122
Can’t they reopen the case?

11:24.147 --> 11:24.986
No.

11:25.011 --> 11:27.666
But the coroner said that he couldn’t find
Bau’s DNA on Mai’s body!

11:27.691 --> 11:29.269
How can we prove that he killed her?

11:29.572 --> 11:30.794
His confession.

11:30.819 --> 11:31.694
What about the weapon?

11:31.750 --> 11:33.370
There’s no object in Bau’s home that

11:33.394 --> 11:34.882
matches the marks found on Mai’s neck.

11:34.922 --> 11:36.370
How would we prosecute him?

11:37.572 --> 11:38.967
His confession.

11:38.992 --> 11:39.826
But sir,

11:40.179 --> 11:41.494
we could lose this case,

11:41.614 --> 11:44.481
if he takes us to court claiming coercion.

11:56.984 --> 11:58.935
You see Officer Nhan sitting there?

11:59.121 --> 12:01.098
He’s been at this station for 20 years.

12:03.423 --> 12:05.298
And yet you still outrank him.

12:05.684 --> 12:06.713
You know why?

12:07.633 --> 12:10.260
Because life is not like the films on TV.

12:10.643 --> 12:13.335
Sometimes the truth is staring
us in the face.

12:13.921 --> 12:15.374
The truth is simple,

12:15.551 --> 12:17.018
because people are simple.

12:17.238 --> 12:19.432
The shows on TV are complicated,

12:19.658 --> 12:23.367
because they need twists to
keep the audience watching.

12:23.785 --> 12:25.640
If you can’t find the weapon,

12:26.051 --> 12:27.259
then go ask Bau.

12:28.327 --> 12:30.910
One Nhan in the department is enough.

12:31.212 --> 12:34.049
Don’t make me regret
recommending you for a promotion.

12:38.801 --> 12:42.294
Stop making bugs eyes at me!

12:42.319 --> 12:44.632
- But I sure Bau could have acted alone!
- Listen...

12:44.657 --> 12:46.574
You... You are always wa...

12:47.674 --> 12:50.296
- Why is he looking at you?
- He’s looking you, sir.

12:50.321 --> 12:51.519
He’s looking at you.

12:51.544 --> 12:52.176
No. He’s not.

12:52.200 --> 12:54.476
I was speculating,
but you accused his aunt!

12:54.501 --> 12:55.629
What’s he doing now?

12:56.369 --> 12:57.203
Cuong!

12:58.039 --> 13:01.574
You reviewed the CCTV footage
on the day that Mai went missing, right?

13:01.599 --> 13:03.297
Right. He’s very good!

13:03.322 --> 13:06.537
Then I need you to go through them again,
even more thoroughly that last time.

13:06.661 --> 13:07.917
This time, look for Bau.

13:08.937 --> 13:10.042
Yes, sir.

13:10.305 --> 13:12.293
Long, sir. Can you tell why?

13:12.318 --> 13:12.985
No.

13:14.231 --> 13:15.821
You ask too many questions.

13:18.658 --> 13:19.582
Long!

13:19.617 --> 13:21.894
- Auntie.
- I need you to reopen the case!

13:21.939 --> 13:25.581
Because of your idiot Uncle,
the previous autopsy was useless!

13:25.606 --> 13:27.122
- Yes, but...
- Don’t argue with me!

13:27.705 --> 13:28.561
Wait...

13:29.775 --> 13:31.191
You’re agreeing with me?

13:31.216 --> 13:31.972
Yes, Auntie.

13:31.997 --> 13:34.332
I’m so relieved!
Now, go tell the Coroner...

13:34.357 --> 13:36.433
That he needs to examine her
extremely thoroughly.

13:36.458 --> 13:37.399
I can’t, Auntie.

13:37.424 --> 13:39.058
Why not? You just agreed with me!

13:39.083 --> 13:42.025
I did, but my superior has already
rejected my request to reopen the case.

13:42.050 --> 13:44.466
But this is your case!
Mai is your cousin!

13:44.565 --> 13:45.348
Auntie.

13:45.429 --> 13:47.793
Auntie, please. I’m begging you.
Please don’t do this, especially here.

13:47.818 --> 13:49.589
It is only because Mai is my cousin...

13:49.614 --> 13:52.192
That my superior has not assigned
this case to another officer.

13:53.684 --> 13:54.434
Long...

13:55.265 --> 13:56.765
I’m pleading with you...

13:57.242 --> 13:58.617
I beg you.

13:59.509 --> 14:00.991
Please help me.

14:02.923 --> 14:06.135
Those bastards who killed Mai
are still out there.

14:06.172 --> 14:07.079
I know.

14:07.104 --> 14:08.616
But there’s no way for me
to reopen the case,

14:08.640 --> 14:10.657
unless I can introduce
new evidence to support it.

14:11.176 --> 14:12.939
If you know something,
then please share it with me.

14:12.964 --> 14:14.676
If not, then I have to obey my superior.

14:14.701 --> 14:16.130
What superior?

14:16.426 --> 14:17.801
What is more noble than Justice?

14:18.140 --> 14:21.525
You grew up with your cousin Mai ever since
she was little. Have you forgotten?

14:21.996 --> 14:24.406
What good is a cop
if he can’t catch criminals!

14:24.890 --> 14:27.917
What good his family relationship
if you can’t protect your own kin!

14:36.390 --> 14:37.556
Mr. Chanh?

14:38.140 --> 14:39.390
Are you home?

14:40.543 --> 14:41.585
Good.

14:42.421 --> 14:44.354
I need to buy your freezer.

14:49.659 --> 14:50.625
Insane.

14:50.650 --> 14:52.102
Your Auntie is really insane!

14:52.127 --> 14:53.096
[11AM - Day 4 Tet]

14:54.297 --> 14:55.750
But she is right.

14:57.793 --> 14:59.248
I am a useless person.

15:00.718 --> 15:02.051
Is that what you think?

15:03.052 --> 15:05.094
My husband is a very capable
police officer.

15:05.348 --> 15:06.820
About to be promoted.

15:06.986 --> 15:08.278
Because he is smart!

15:08.863 --> 15:12.113
And because he is smart, he cannot
be manipulated by anyone.

15:17.580 --> 15:19.483
I can accept staying up all night,

15:19.781 --> 15:21.476
waiting for you go back from work.

15:22.647 --> 15:25.238
I can even accept that Hoa is our relative.

15:25.705 --> 15:28.219
But what I cannot accept
is this in our home!

15:29.661 --> 15:31.676
I know that Mai is your cousin.

15:31.955 --> 15:33.572
I know that you love her.

15:33.719 --> 15:34.719
But...

15:36.020 --> 15:38.349
You need to love your wife and child, too.

15:38.794 --> 15:40.679
I’m going to stay in the back house.

15:41.719 --> 15:42.871
Just until...

15:43.059 --> 15:44.569
You’ve regained yourself.

15:50.496 --> 15:52.508
At which time, you need to decide...

15:52.918 --> 15:54.460
What is best for our family.

16:25.271 --> 16:26.366
My condolences.

16:26.666 --> 16:29.552
- For the loss of your daughter...
- I don’t need your platitudes.

16:30.621 --> 16:31.958
Who is that dog name Dan?

16:32.752 --> 16:34.268
The one who rolls with Co.

16:34.395 --> 16:35.270
Where does he live?

16:36.051 --> 16:37.849
We’re both pushers.

16:38.505 --> 16:40.837
Snitches get stitches.

16:41.218 --> 16:44.084
What lives in our gut,
we take to the grave.

16:45.587 --> 16:47.349
Tell that son of a bitch, Dan...

16:47.496 --> 16:48.871
I already took care of Co.

16:49.835 --> 16:51.210
Now I’m coming for him.

16:52.645 --> 16:54.770
Tell him that if he wants
to save his sorry ass...

16:54.905 --> 16:57.932
then pray to heaven and Buddha
that the cops get him before I do.

18:13.805 --> 18:14.931
Mai.

18:17.533 --> 18:19.585
Ever since you’ve been back from the city,

18:21.702 --> 18:23.899
we have not really had
much time to talk.

18:27.642 --> 18:29.198
And then you disappeared.

18:34.458 --> 18:36.295
And I couldn’t even help find you

18:37.598 --> 18:38.905
and save you.

18:50.432 --> 18:52.486
Now the only thing that I can do,

18:57.500 --> 18:59.625
is to help you sleep peacefully.

19:05.541 --> 19:07.317
But I need your help, Mai.

20:33.108 --> 20:35.782
Were you strangled twice, Mai?

20:38.368 --> 20:41.660
[10PM - New Year’s Day]

21:06.231 --> 21:07.523
Shhh! I’m not going to hurt you.

21:07.548 --> 21:09.376
Please don’t yell. You’ll wake him.

21:09.835 --> 21:12.334
I promise, I won’t hurt you. Don’t scream.

21:12.463 --> 21:14.092
Don’t scream, okay?

21:14.689 --> 21:16.183
Don’t scream...

21:18.288 --> 21:19.317
Don’t...

21:20.539 --> 21:21.682
Don’t, okay?

21:24.031 --> 21:25.189
Miss...

21:25.614 --> 21:26.848
Please let me go...

21:27.582 --> 21:29.515
Please let me go...

21:30.408 --> 21:33.190
Please help untie me.

21:34.109 --> 21:34.942
I can’t.

21:44.338 --> 21:46.501
I don’t want to die here.

21:46.593 --> 21:48.660
Please, miss, let me go home.

21:48.863 --> 21:51.208
I can’t. I promise you.
You won’t die.

21:51.251 --> 21:52.828
They have no intention of killing you.

21:53.410 --> 21:55.645
They just want your mother to pay them.

21:55.989 --> 21:58.647
You’ll get to go home as soon as
your mother pays them.

21:59.355 --> 22:00.188
No.

22:00.536 --> 22:03.009
No. Please take me to the hospital.

22:03.228 --> 22:05.358
My stomach is really hurting.

22:07.189 --> 22:08.267
Why is that?

22:08.292 --> 22:09.545
My stomach hurts.

22:10.111 --> 22:12.911
Why? You haven’t eaten anything yet.

22:14.757 --> 22:16.866
Please take me to the hospital.

22:16.891 --> 22:19.323
I promise. You won’t die.

22:19.347 --> 22:20.718
I promise you.

22:20.838 --> 22:22.338
Don’t worry.

22:23.726 --> 22:26.968
You don’t have to worry.
I won’t let them kill you.

22:30.556 --> 22:32.098
Please have some porridge, okay?

22:32.123 --> 22:34.080
Try to eat some porridge, okay?

22:37.462 --> 22:40.211
Please. Just try to eat a bite.

22:50.757 --> 22:52.698
Stop!.... Stop!

22:52.841 --> 22:54.246
- Stop it!
- Stay away!

22:54.271 --> 22:55.299
[12:15AM - Day 3 Tet]

22:57.168 --> 23:00.550
Why did you kill her? You promised!
You said that you wouldn’t kill her!

23:01.259 --> 23:03.324
- Things have changed.
- How changed?

23:04.400 --> 23:06.013
It’s because you let them rape her!

23:06.038 --> 23:07.217
Fuck you!

23:12.903 --> 23:13.880
Where are you going?

23:16.305 --> 23:18.568
I told you that
I didn’t want to keep her here.

23:20.906 --> 23:22.544
Co lied to us!

23:22.809 --> 23:24.731
That girl’s mother will never pay.

23:25.540 --> 23:28.677
Bau told you...
that her father would pay.

23:28.702 --> 23:30.407
That was our last hope!

23:30.648 --> 23:32.475
Why would you still kill her?

23:33.692 --> 23:35.025
Get smart!

23:36.246 --> 23:38.329
Use your brain to think!

23:38.893 --> 23:40.304
She’s seen me.

23:40.642 --> 23:42.094
She’s seen you.

23:42.556 --> 23:44.223
If she goes to the cops,

23:45.137 --> 23:46.778
our whole lot goes to jail!

23:47.429 --> 23:49.220
Not to mention those filthy animals!

23:50.171 --> 23:51.656
What they did to her...

23:54.082 --> 23:57.113
But it was you who let them.

23:57.463 --> 24:00.043
- You’re no different from them.
- What?

24:03.020 --> 24:04.423
You disrespect me?

24:06.017 --> 24:07.990
You’re looking down on me?

24:09.091 --> 24:10.627
You hate me, don’t you?

24:12.922 --> 24:14.541
Think about it.

24:15.681 --> 24:17.198
If I go to jail,

24:17.973 --> 24:19.622
then who will take care of you?

24:21.611 --> 24:22.778
Who will feed you?

24:23.947 --> 24:27.572
There is no one else in this world...

24:28.094 --> 24:30.631
who would stay with
a barren woman like you.

24:31.726 --> 24:32.892
Trust me.

24:33.624 --> 24:34.899
Only I would!

24:52.090 --> 24:53.423
Don’t be scared.

24:55.187 --> 24:56.895
I’ll take care of everything.

24:57.708 --> 24:59.435
Let me do the dirty work.

25:00.447 --> 25:01.467
You should...

25:02.123 --> 25:03.300
Go back inside.

25:03.981 --> 25:05.767
Wipe out all traces...

25:07.501 --> 25:09.638
Even the marks on her body.

25:12.431 --> 25:13.215
Okay?

25:30.075 --> 25:31.242
Go...

25:57.872 --> 26:01.132
Mai was not strangled once with
a rope. Look carefully...

26:01.203 --> 26:03.261
These marks were made by chains.

26:03.711 --> 26:05.081
On 2 separate occasions.

26:05.106 --> 26:06.405
[4:30PM - Day 4 Tet]
The lighter mark is older.

26:06.430 --> 26:08.056
[4:30PM - Day 4 Tet]
That was made when she was kidnapped.

26:08.541 --> 26:10.097
The darker marks are more recent.

26:10.406 --> 26:12.294
This was when they killed Mai.

26:13.302 --> 26:17.497
Did you aunt... Really bring Mai’s
corpse to your house in a freezer?

26:17.640 --> 26:19.606
Auntie is determined to do
whatever it takes

26:19.631 --> 26:21.333
for us to reopen the case.

26:21.949 --> 26:24.108
Despite the protests from my wife
and all of the neighbors.

26:24.321 --> 26:25.715
Even I can’t appease them.

26:27.289 --> 26:28.457
You are aware...

26:28.749 --> 26:30.501
If you reopen this case,

26:30.591 --> 26:32.799
then you will void Bau’s confession.

26:33.173 --> 26:34.548
You’ll have to release him.

26:36.055 --> 26:37.008
I think...

26:37.351 --> 26:39.498
Bau is also one of the accomplices
in the kidnapping.

26:39.587 --> 26:40.885
If we reopen the case,

26:40.910 --> 26:43.633
I’ll be authorized toassign officers
to follow him and his known associates.

26:43.658 --> 26:45.200
Though we may lose the confession,

26:45.558 --> 26:48.638
we stand to catch the real killer,

26:48.663 --> 26:50.786
and win a stronger conviction for Bau
and the killer!

27:15.416 --> 27:18.833
[2AM - Day 3 Tet]

27:26.645 --> 27:30.466
The afternoon has no scent

27:30.491 --> 27:33.454
The blue gradually fades

27:33.479 --> 27:37.847
Immerse yourself in nostalgia

27:37.947 --> 27:41.758
Revived just listening

27:41.783 --> 27:48.109
Spring has returned
to hold her obedient babe

27:48.437 --> 27:54.028
Wait until your love is fragrant

27:54.053 --> 27:59.216
Wait until your heart has no ruler

27:59.469 --> 28:03.510
All the pain...

28:05.426 --> 28:08.509
Of night and day

28:33.575 --> 28:38.906
Do not expect the storm to pass

28:38.930 --> 28:44.265
When your heart is not at peace

28:44.290 --> 28:53.540
The remnants of tears make me feel
like a fool who cannot come out

28:54.298 --> 28:57.546
Forget yourself...

29:35.302 --> 29:36.379
Miss Xuan!

29:40.530 --> 29:41.808
Are you miss Pham Hoai Xuan?

29:41.853 --> 29:43.603
[7PM - Day 4 Tet]

29:43.663 --> 29:44.496
Yes.

29:44.900 --> 29:46.429
Sorry to bother you.

29:48.361 --> 29:49.555
My name is Long.

29:49.755 --> 29:52.005
The officer in charge of the
Ha Thi Mai investigation.

29:53.226 --> 29:55.350
I need to get some more
information from you.

29:55.993 --> 29:57.300
Would you mind...

29:57.325 --> 29:59.200
Answering a few questions for me?

30:04.206 --> 30:05.933
MISSING: EVE OF TET
